"{\"schema_version\":4,\"contract_version\":\"skill-ir-semantic-contract-v2\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"finding_1\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"原文规定技能用于用户请求调试或修复 GitHub Actions 中失败的 PR checks；用 gh 检查 checks/logs、总结失败上下文、拟定修复计划、仅在显式批准后实施；外部 provider（如 Buildkite）不在范围内且只报告 details URL；前置认证 gh auth login/status；若存在 create-plan 类技能则使用，否则内联起草并请求批准后再实施。\",\"actual_representation\":\"受控图通过 /constraints/0-4 逐条记录上述图级声明，并在 /contexts、/entry 以及输入、认证、计划、审批等块中分别承接。约束是声明，不等于已实现；原文要求文本已被保留。\",\"reason\":\"逐条比对 /constraints/0-4 与 SKILL.md front matter、Overview 和 Prereq；未发现对象、范围或条件被改动。注意这些是声明字段，不能据此推断运行成功。\",\"source_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"src_034\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":3,\"end_line\":3,\"quote\":\"Use when a user asks to debug or fix failing GitHub PR checks that run in GitHub Actions\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_037\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":12,\"end_line\":12,\"quote\":\"If a plan-oriented skill (for example `create-plan`) is available, use it; otherwise draft a concise plan inline and request approval before implementing.\"},{\"unit_id\":\"src_038\",\"file\":\"SKILL.md\",\"start_line\":14,\"end_line\":14,\"quote\":\"Prereq: authenticate with the standard GitHub CLI once (for example, run `gh auth login`), then confirm with `gh auth status` (repo + workflow scopes are typically required).\"}],\"controlled_refs\":[{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/entry\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/contexts\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/0\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/1\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/2\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/3\",\"quote\":null},{\"unit_id\":\"fact:/constraints/4\",\"quote\":null}],\"basis\":[\"declared_constraint\",\"explicit_graph\"],\"suggestions\":[]},{\"id\":\"finding_2\",\"kind\":\"semantic\",\"status\":\"represented\",\"source_requirement\":\"Inputs：`repo` 是仓库内路径，默认 `.`；`pr` 是 PR number 或 URL，可选，默认当前分支 PR；需要 repo host 的 `gh` 认